.                 * time use variables: i)time use chores, ii) time use childre
> n, iii) time use chores + children
. replace pli0011=. if pli0011<0
(212,521 real changes made, 212,521 to missing)

. replace pli0012_h=. if pli0012_h<0
(206,830 real changes made, 206,830 to missing)

. replace pli0040=. if pli0040<0          
