. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H3 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. 
.         * I run an OLS model where we study whether gender of the first child
>  (daughter) impacts the average number of hourse spend on chores and children
. 
.         reg avg_h_chores_children daughter sex sumkids  

      Source |       SS           df       MS      Number of obs   =   164,258
